          "message": {
            "text": "The ICU companion is versioned independently from Domotion's npm package. This lets a pinned Chromium ICU build be replaced or rebuilt without forcing an application release, while the cache key prevents incompatible helper/data pairs from mixing.",
            "markdown": "The ICU companion is versioned independently from Domotion's npm package. This lets a pinned Chromium ICU build be replaced or rebuilt without forcing an application release, while the cache key prevents incompatible helper/data pairs from mixing."
          },
